At run time this product retrieves bibliographic and citation data from the
Semantic Scholar API (Allen Institute for AI), subject to the Semantic Scholar
API license terms, and may send paper metadata to the Anthropic API when the
user supplies an API key.

Binary releases (built with packaging/build.py) bundle PySide6 / Qt, licensed
under LGPL-3.0; the license texts are included next to the app. The Qt libraries
are shipped as replaceable shared libraries.
